## Problem 2: Implement Stack using Queues (LeetCode 225)

### Problem Statement
Implement a Last In First Out (LIFO) stack using queues.

### Operations Supported
- push(x)
- pop()
- top()
- empty()

### Approach
Use one queue:
- Push element and rotate queue so new element comes to front

### Time Complexity
- Push: O(n)
- Pop: O(1)
- Top: O(1)
- Empty: O(1)

### Space Complexity
O(n)

